text But the class eventually starts, and the whole school sinks into silence.
text I should be able to sneak out safely now.
text I step toward the window.
text *Rattle*
text @[Tomoya]
text Hm?
text The window is opening on its own.
text Right after that, the body of a well-built man appears, crouches down, and leans forward over the window frame to get in.
music BGM08A.mp3
sound G1Y.aac
text @[Man]
text Here we go... Can't they make this thing just a bit bigger...
text The man uses his big hands to dust off his clothes while looking at me with narrowed eyes.
text @[Man]
text ...
text He keeps on staring at me.
text It's not a glare, nor does it look like he's trying to pick a fight.
text These are the eyes of an inspector examining his target.
text @[Tomoya]
text What is it?
sound G1Z.aac
text @[Man]
text I haven't seen you before.
text @[Tomoya]
text Isn't that because you're not a student at this school?
sound G20.aac
text @[Man]
text Neither are you.
text @[Tomoya]
text I am, actually.
sound G21.aac
text @[Man]
text You're not wearing the uniform.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm under suspension.
sound G22.aac
text @[Man]
text Suspension? So there are people stupid enough to get suspended even in this school?
text @[Tomoya]
text Are you picking a fight with me?
sound G23.aac
text @[Man]
text Nope, not my intention. It's just that I don't find people like you often in this kind of school.
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, I guess.
sound G24.aac
text @[Man]
text So.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hm?
sound G25.aac
text @[Man]
text What are you to Yukine?
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm not sure how to answer that question.
sound G26.aac
text @[Man]
text Her boyfriend or something?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...No... That's not it.
sound G27.aac
text @[Man]
text Figured as much, or else you wouldn't be kicking around like this now. Yep.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text I feel like he just said something pretty scary...
text I suppose this just goes to show how much these people adore Miyazawa.
text Or perhaps there's an unspoken agreement among them against sneaky advancement on her.
text Still fixing his eyes on me, the man sits down on a nearby chair.
text @[Tomoya]
text Why are you looking at me like that...
sound G28.aac
text @[Man]
text I was watching.
text @[Tomoya]
text Watching what?
sound G29.aac
text @[Man]
text Yukine sleeping on your lap.
sound G2A.aac
text @[Man]
text How could I step in seeing something like that? Geez.
text @[Tomoya]
text When did you start watching us...?
sound G2B.aac
text @[Man]
text When you started eating the pilaf she made.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text So he's seen almost everything...
text That aside, what the hell made you sit outside the window watching for over an hour...?
sound G2C.aac
text @[Man]
text So.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hm?
text The man bends forward, setting his elbows on his knees while putting his chin on interlaced fingers and sharpens his eyes.
sound G2D.aac
text @[Man]
text What are you to Yukine?
text The same question as before.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...I'm an upperclassman to her. That's all...
sound G2E.aac
text @[Man]
text So upperclassmen offer that kind of service now? Lap-pillow, was it?
text Hmph... He laughs through his nose.
sound G2F.aac
text @[Man]
text I haven't seen Yukine fawning on anyone for quite some time...
text @[Tomoya]
text Isn't that just because there wasn't anyone for her to fawn on?
sound G2G.aac
text @[Man]
text I guess so. People like us just ain't the best substitutes.
text @[Tomoya]
text Substitute?
sound G2H.aac
text @[Man]
text Or rather, it's also because we were fawning on her first.
sound G2I.aac
text @[Man]
text Now that I think about it carefully, that's such a strange thing we did. Geez.
sound G2J.aac
text @[Man]
text I still remember what a sweet little thing she was back then...
sound G2K.aac
text @[Man]
text Truth be told, we should've been the ones pampering her. And yet...
text @[Tomoya]
text I don't understand what you are talking about.
text @[Tomoya]
text And what did you mean by "substitute"?
sound G2L.aac
text @[Man]
text So you don't know anything?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...?
sound G2M.aac
text @[Man]
text Even about her brother?
text @[Tomoya]
text Miyazawa only told me that I felt like her brother.
sound G2N.aac
text @[Man]
text Aah... So that's how it is.
text The man slowly nods twice, having seemingly understood everything.
text Then he raises his eyes to stare at me again.
sound G2O.aac
text @[Man]
text ...Which part of you did she find to be like him...?
text @[Tomoya]
text How should I know?
sound G2P.aac
text @[Man]
text Well, it's not like we could put you and him side by side to compare...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Does her brother know about what she's doing right now?
text @[Tomoya]
text If I were her brother, I would never want her to be like she is now.
sound G2Q.aac
text @[Man]
text Same here. I'm sure he himself wouldn't have wanted this to happen.
text @[Tomoya]
text Can't he stop her?
sound G2R.aac
text @[Man]
text That's... just not possible.
text @[Tomoya]
text So he's scared of confronting the delinquents? What a gutless guy.
text *Punch*
