text One of them is coming this way.
text I try to move away without making a single sound.
text The washroom is this way... but it's a dead-end, so I probably should take another route...
text Maybe it's safer to take refuge in the courtyard...
text @[Tomoya]
text This is bad...
text Yes... The stage is my school.
text And right now, I'm being chased.
text The pursuers are none other than the respectable teachers.
text I was seen trying to climb through the window of the reference room.
