text *Ding dong ding dong ding dong*
text @[Tomoya]
text Gaah... Lunch break has already started...
text Things are getting worse.
text If other teachers start joining in the hunt as well, there's no way I can escape.
text Even better, the students are going to make a ruckus when they see me.
text I should have worn the freaking uniform.
text It could have helped me blend into the crowd.
text Anyway... gotta find a way out of here...
text In the first place, why was I being such an overly honest fool coming to the reference room?
text Is anyone going to die if I don't go there for one day?
