text I do as I'm told.
text My vision is now covered in darkness...
text For all I know, this warmth in my arms may very well be the only true thing in the world at this moment.
text I can feel her heartbeat with my entire body.
text Now I feel embarrassed. I should have learned how to control the speed of my heartbeat.
text The scent of her silky hair is making me dizzy...
text Aah... This is indeed embarrassing, but is that all there is to it...?
sound G7E.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text In your mind...
text From the darkness, her voice takes me by surprise.
text I was so immersed in her warmth, I've forgotten why we're even here...
sound G7F.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text ...In your mind, please chant the phrase I said three times.
text FACING FORWARD, FACING FORWARD, FACING FORWARD...
text That should be enough...
text The silence of this spell is getting to me.
text How long am I supposed to embrace her...?
text Has it been long enough already...?
text At least, she hasn't shown any sign of wanting me to let go yet.
text As I slightly pull my head down, I can feel her hair touching my lips.
text Slowly... I press my lips against her head while praying she doesn't notice.
text The ticklish sensation...
text The softness...
text The pleasant scent...
text I wonder what those people would do to me if they found me with her like this...
text This spell could literally cost me my life...
text *Ding dong ding dong ding dong*
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text @[Miyazawa]
text ...
