text I definitely think we are out of place...
text Everyone who's gathered here are those who shared memories with her brother, and they're here to mourn him.
text But I've never even met him. All I can do now is keep my mouth shut and sympathize with the crowd's atmosphere.
text Why did she even call me here...
text Why did she ask me to do that embracing spell...
text I have a convenient interpretation for everything, but in the end it's just that: my own interpretation.
text If it's wrong, then continuing to push forward will just turn me into an excessively self-conscious clown...
