text Several people have already gathered in front of the grave even before our arrival.
text They all greet Miyazawa in the same manner.
text Sunohara and I stand off at a distance and watch.
text They are now putting their offerings before the gravestone, and one by one, they start to report on their present lives.
text ─I'm going to a professional school now.─
text With that, an incense stick is put down...
text ─Actually, I've become a father. I'm getting married soon.─
text Another stick...
text ─I've found a job. It's just labor, but I'm feeling very satisfied.─
text And another stick...
text ─In the end, you never let me take my revenge.─
text One after another...
text ─I wanted to play around with you more.─
text The white smoke drifts away toward the sky...
