text She takes my hand and walks to the grave.
text The incense holder placed in front of the perfectly cleaned gravestone is already tightly packed with everyone's offerings.
text Even so, I somehow manage to put mine in without breaking anything.
text I put my hands together and close my eyes...
text There's only one thing I can report to him...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text ─Your sister... She's still doing her best.
text ─Even with all these people adoring her, she never goes easy on herself...
text ─And she keeps living on so strongly, so straightforward.
sound G8H.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Would you please listen to my story?
text I open my eyes in surprise upon hearing her voice.
text Did she say that to me alone? Or did she mean it to be heard by everyone here?
text The only thing I know is, she's gotten the attention of all the attendees.
sound G8I.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text It's the story of my family.
sound G8J.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text I once had a brother.
sound G8K.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text When he was at home, he would always fight with our parents.
sound G8L.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Because they wanted to raise both of us as strictly as possible...
sound G8M.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text My brother must have felt discontent with that.
sound G8N.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Why do we have to walk the road our parents have decided for us?
sound G8O.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text There must be a freer way to live.
sound G8P.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text There are just as many roads out there as there are people... he said.
sound G8Q.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text That's how he rebelled.
sound G8R.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text I grew up constantly following what my parents told me to. Learning the arts, studying for school.
sound G8S.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text My brother became rougher as he got bigger...
sound G8T.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text At the same time, I came to be called "courteous" by other people...
sound G8U.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text It was as if... we'd grown up on different sides of a mirror.
sound G8V.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Even then... we were so close, my brother and I.
sound G8W.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text You could say that we cared about each other like a couple of lovers.
sound G8X.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text But then, when he got into high school, he made many new friends and stopped coming home.
sound G8Y.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Everyone would point at him and call him...
sound G8Z.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text ...a delinquent.
sound G90.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text But on the occasions when I got to meet him, he always seemed so lively.
sound G91.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text He even told me, living inside our house was no less than hell, but the outside world was so exciting he couldn't help it.
sound G92.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text My brother... he'd made a lot of companions.
sound G93.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text No matter what society might think, he was very proud of them.
sound G94.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text At the time, I didn't dare to meet my brother's friends.
sound G95.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Back then, I was just a normal girl...
sound G96.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text I was scared of them.
sound G97.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text My brother had found his own place to be, living as freely as he pleased.
sound G98.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Thinking back, it would have been no different if my parents had disowned him or not...
sound G99.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Every time they met him, he would find something to fight about and leave.
sound G9A.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text He started living far away from our parents.
sound G9B.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text But even then, he would come back just to see me.
sound G9C.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Bringing lots of sweets as presents for me.
sound G9D.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Those sweets he gave me... my parents would never allow them.
sound G9E.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text But I ate them all, until my teeth decided to rebel against me.
sound G9F.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text The times we spent together were nothing short of joy.
sound G9G.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text My brother would eat the lunch I made...
sound G9H.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text ...and I would sleep on his lap...
sound G9I.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text It was so much fun... I never felt more peaceful.
sound G9J.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text But... it didn't last for long.
sound G9K.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text My brother, an accident... took him away from me forever.
sound G9L.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text In the very end, I heard he was still trying to protect one of his friends.
sound G9M.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text My parents lamented... "That was what he got for staying with those people."
sound G9N.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text I didn't understand...
sound G9O.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text ...if what they'd said was true or not.
sound G9P.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text But...
sound G9Q.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text ...I knew my brother was a respectable man.
sound G9R.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text On the day of his funeral...
sound G9S.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text A lot of his friends came.
sound G9T.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text They had so many colors on them... and their attitude, too, wasn't appreciated by other guests...
sound G9U.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text And yet... their eyes when they stood before my brother were so earnest.
sound G9V.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Some of them even cried...
sound G9W.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text They were truly connected with my brother through a deep bond of friendship. They were his true friends.
sound G9X.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text That's why I decided to...
sound G9Y.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text ...gather my courage and speak to them.
sound G9Z.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text I told them I was the younger sister of Kazuto Miyazawa...
sound GA0.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text We only talked for a little...
sound GA1.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text ...but thanks to that, I came to know how much pain they felt from losing my brother...
sound GA2.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text And...
sound GA3.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text ...I realized I wanted to help those people who had been together with my dear brother...
sound GA4.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text ...by filling in the empty space in their hearts...
sound GA5.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text That's what I thought at that moment.
sound GA6.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Because they were...
sound GA7.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Every one of them felt just like him.
sound GA8.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text They were so rash, so rough, so dishonest with themselves...
sound GA9.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text More than anything, they were kind, enough to become reckless for the sake of others.
sound GAA.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text To me, they looked just like my brother.
sound GAB.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text But it wasn't easy at all.
sound GAC.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Because, you see, I was but a normal girl...
sound GAD.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text And being just as strong as any other normal girl, I was powerless...
sound GAE.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Even then, I started going to places my brother had been.
sound GAF.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text I started talking to many people.
sound GAG.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text I can't even remember how many times I was pushed away.
sound GAH.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text There were even times when fright seized me.
if 0 == 0
	goto s122
fi
goto 144
label s122
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
goto 146
label 144
if 0 == 1
	goto s123
fi
goto 145
label s123
setvar strS[1000] = "SIRO"
goto 146
label 145
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
label 146
setvar strS[1001] = ""
setvar intF[1113] = 0
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setvar strS[1000] = "FGYK01A"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s124
fi
goto 147
label s124
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 147
setvar strS[1001] = ""
setvar intF[1113] = 0
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
text For the old Miyazawa, those places must have been like a whole other world.
text What a fragile creature she must have been.
text How I wish I could have known her then...
text I would have run to her side, to be with her.
if 0 == 0
	goto s125
fi
goto 148
label s125
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
goto 150
label 148
if 0 == 1
	goto s126
fi
goto 149
label s126
setvar strS[1000] = "SIRO"
goto 150
label 149
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
label 150
setvar strS[1001] = ""
setvar intF[1113] = 0
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
sound GAI.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Then came the winter. I remember knitting gloves for everyone.
sound GAJ.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text On especially cold nights, I would give away hot bean soup.
sound GAK.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text But it wasn't quite successful. My taste was too sweet for everyone...
sound GAL.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Christmas Eve was really memorable for me. I was running around delivering the cakes I made.
sound GAM.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text But for some reason, I was the only one dressing as Santa Claus...
sound GAN.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text It was so embarrassing...
sound GAO.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text But even then, everyone... accepted and ate my cakes.
setvar strS[1000] = "FGYK01B"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s127
fi
goto 151
label s127
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 151
setvar strS[1001] = ""
setvar intF[1113] = 0
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
sound GAP.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text That was when they started to respond to me.
sound GAQ.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text They'd start saying things like "Thanks for the treats"...
sound GAR.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text More than that, I was no longer the first one to start up a conversation. They'd start greeting me themselves, saying "You've come again"...
setvar strS[1000] = "FGYK01C"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s128
fi
goto 152
label s128
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 152
setvar strS[1001] = ""
setvar intF[1113] = 0
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
sound GAS.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Then people began to gather around me...
sound GAT.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text They've given me so much warmth...
sound GAU.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Before I noticed... they became a place where I could find my peace of mind.
sound GAV.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text They've become a second family to me.
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s129
fi
goto 153
label s129
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 153
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text Perhaps tired from the long speech, Miyazawa starts closing her eyes.
text Or maybe she's trying to redraw the kindness-filled scenery on the back of her eyelids.
text But for what reason? It's right there before her the moment she opens her eyes.
music ~
jump SEEN5430_1_0.scr
